## Vehicle Hardpoint Printer Tooltips
## If not defined here, defaults to what is in its yaml file.

## Tank - Primary Weapons

ent-VehicleTankLTBCannon = LTB Cannon
    .printer-desc = A light cannon attached to the primary hardpoint.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-ltb-cannon }
ent-VehicleTankLTAAAPMinigun = LTAA-AP Minigun
    .printer-desc = An anti-air minigun system that speeds up as it fires.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-ltaaap-minigun }
ent-VehicleTankAceAutocannon = AC3-E Autocannon
    .printer-desc = A precise long range autocannon system that shoots flak rounds.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-ace-autocannon }
ent-VehicleTankDragonFlamer = DRG-N Flamer
    .printer-desc = A powerful flamer system designed to expel high-combustion napalm in a wide area.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-drgn-flamer }

## Tank - Secondary Weapons
ent-VehicleTankFlamer = M34-V Flamer
    .printer-desc = A M34 designed specifically for a tank's hardpoint.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-flamer }
ent-VehicleTankGrenadeLauncher = M85-V Grenade Launcher
    .printer-desc = A M85 designed specifically for a tank's hardpoint.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-grenadelauncher }
ent-VehicleTankTowLauncher = TOW Launcher
    .printer-desc = A rocket launcher mounted on a tank's secondary hardpoint.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-tow-launcher }
ent-VehicleTankM56Cupola = ML56-V Cupola
    .printer-desc = A ML66 variant modified specifically for a tank's hardpoint.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-ml56v-cupola }

## Tank - Armor
ent-VehicleTankArmorBallistic = Ballistic Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases resistance to [color=yellow]pierce[/color] and [color=orange]slashing[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankArmorConcussive = Concussive Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases resistance to [color=orange]blunt[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankArmorCaustic = Caustic Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases resistance to [color=green]acidic[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankArmorPaladin = Paladin Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases resistance to [color=red]explosive[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankSnowplow = Tank Snowplow
    .printer-desc = A reinforced plow that looks like it was made for a tank.

## Tank - Support
ent-VehicleTankWarningArray = Integrated Weapons Sensor Array
    .printer-desc = Improves accuracy and fire rate of all onboard weapons.
ent-VehicleTankOverdriveEnhancer = Overdrive Enhancer
    .printer-desc = Increases movement speed.
ent-VehicleTankRocketLauncher = Smoke Launcher
    .printer-desc = Launches smoke grenades in all directions.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-smokelauncher }
ent-VehicleTankFlareModule = Flare Module
    .printer-desc = Launches flares in all directions.
        { rmc-ammo-examine-flaremodule }
ent-VehicleTankArtilleryModule = Artillery Module
    .printer-desc = Enables long range optics for the tank's gunner.

## Tank - Treads
ent-VehicleTankTreads = Tank Treads
    .printer-desc = Standard tank treads vital for movement.
ent-VehicleTankReinforcedTreads = Reinforced Tank Treads
    .printer-desc = Accelerates [color=orange]slower[/color] due to weight but offers better durability and [color=green]acid[/color] resistance.

## Humvee ARC?
